{"title":"Career Roadmap: Risk Manager","role":"Risk Manager","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – CFA / FRM / Actuarial (IAI) · Target Career: Risk Manager","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"CFA / FRM / Actuarial (IAI)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Risk Manager finds, measures and controls risks - credit, market, liquidity and operational - for banks, insurers, funds and companies."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Risk Manager does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Measure risks with models and data"},{"text":"Set and monitor risk limits"},{"text":"Report risks to management and regulators"},{"text":"Design risk policies and controls"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banks and NBFCs"},{"text":"Insurance companies"},{"text":"Asset managers"},{"text":"Consulting and Big 4 risk teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Risk Manager"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Risk"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Chief Risk Officer"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Level / Part I: Foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear FRM Part I (or CFA Level I)"},{"text":"Statistics and probability"},{"text":"Excel and Python basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Level / Part II: Risk depth"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear FRM Part II"},{"text":"Learn Basel norms and RBI risk rules"},{"text":"Build a simple VaR model"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience: Qualify"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Work in a risk team"},{"text":"Complete FRM experience requirement"},{"text":"Specialise in credit, market or operational risk"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Note","text":"FRM needs two years of relevant work experience to be certified."}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Risk modelling (VaR, credit risk)"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Regulation (Basel, RBI)"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Python / SQL"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Independent judgement"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Clear reporting"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Integrity"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Risk systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bank risk teams"},{"text":"Big 4 risk advisory"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FRM (GARP)"},{"text":"PRM (PRMIA)"},{"text":"CFA"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Finance / M.Sc Quantitative Finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FRM Part I and II"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Options